    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">This is a plain-language summary of how this website handles your information. Last updated: <time>{{ page.date | readableDate }}</time>.</p>

    <h2 class="h-section mt-12">What we collect</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700">We collect only what you choose to send us through the contact or checkup form:</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-lg text-gray-700">
      <li>Your name and email address (required).</li>
      <li>Optionally, your business name, website, phone number and a message, along with anything else the form asks for.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700">Please don't put health, financial or other sensitive details in the form. We don't need them to get started.</p>

    <h2 class="h-section mt-12">Why we collect it</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700">To reply to you, and to deliver your Free Tech Checkup or answer your question. We don't use it for anything else.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700">If you give us your website address, we look at the public home page once, automatically, to prepare for your checkup. We also use Cloudflare's AI service to help draft our first reply to you. A person reads and edits that reply before anything is sent.</p>

    <h2 class="h-section mt-12">Where it goes</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700">This site is hosted by Cloudflare, and your form submission is handled through that hosting so it can reach us. It is stored there and sent to our email inbox. Like most hosting providers, Cloudflare may keep standard technical records, such as IP addresses, to run and protect the service.</p>

    <h2 class="h-section mt-12">What we don't do</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-lg text-gray-700">
      <li>We don't use advertising trackers or analytics cookies on this site.</li>
      <li>We don't sell your information.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h-section mt-12">Asking us to delete your information</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700">If you want us to delete what you sent us, tell us through the <a class="link" href="/contact/">contact form</a>{% if site.email %} or by email at <a class="link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>{% endif %}. We will reply within {{ site.responseTime }}.</p>

    <p class="mt-12 text-gray-700">See also our <a class="link" href="/terms/">terms of use</a> and <a class="link" href="/accessibility/">accessibility statement</a>.</p>
